      "parameters": {
        "content": "**Purpose:**  \nHandles AI → Human escalation by bridging the web chat with Figmenta’s internal Discord team.\n\n**How it works:**  \n• Triggered by the main workflow when the user chooses “Talk to someone now”  \n• Receives **session_id** and the user’s latest query  \n• Creates a dedicated Discord thread named after the session  \n• Saves the Discord **thread_id** in Supabase to lock the conversation state  \n• Forwards the user’s message to the Discord thread  \n• Waits for a human response and captures it in real time  \n\n**Why this matters:**  \nEnsures seamless human takeover, prevents AI response collisions, and keeps the web chat, Discord, and database perfectly synchronized.\n",
        "height": 352,
        "width": 560
      },
